@startuml
title DefarFlow v0.1 - Architecture cible

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Utilisateur" as User

component "Frontend React" as React {
  [Pages]
  [Formulaires]
  [Tableaux de bord]
}

component "Backend Django REST API" as Django {
  [Authentification]
  [Organisations]
  [Demandes]
  [Interventions]
  [Notifications]
}

database "PostgreSQL" as Postgres
cloud "Stockage fichiers" as Storage
cloud "Email" as Email

User --> React : navigateur web
React --> Django : HTTPS / JSON
Django --> Postgres : ORM Django
Django --> Storage : photos
Django --> Email : notifications

@enduml
